      {
        "id": "ci_058a75147006271d006989e09ca14c81a2891cca07f1f685ad",
        "code": "ratio = 0.765\ndef net(gross, non_tax=0):\n    return gross*ratio + non_tax\n\nfor stab in [7000, 10000, 15000, 20000]:\n    gross = 72590 + 0.10*72590 + 6000 + 3600 + stab  # tariff + 10% perf + special 6000 + resp 3600 + stabil\n    print(stab, gross, net(gross, non_tax=6000))",
